cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "USB4000 Calibration: Wavelength-Axis and Absolute Radiometric Calibration Pipelines"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Douglas O."
    family-names: "Novaes"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9504-9872"
    affiliation: "Institute of Physics, University of Sao Paulo (IFUSP)"
abstract: >-
  Two calibration pipelines for the same Ocean Optics USB4000
  spectrometer: a wavelength-axis calibration from Hg/Ne emission
  lines, whose stated end application is the spectral characterization
  of a cold dielectric-barrier-discharge (DBD) plasma, and an absolute
  radiometric calibration of the same instrument against a
  NIST-traceable FEL standard lamp.
keywords:
  - spectrometer calibration
  - wavelength calibration
  - radiometric calibration
  - plasma spectroscopy
  - dielectric barrier discharge
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
